  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 3.45,
      "end": 4.45,
      "text": "Hello.",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "identified_speaker": "CUSTOMER",
      "display_speaker": "Customer"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.45,
      "end": 5.45,
      "text": "Hello.",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "identified_speaker": "AGENT",
      "display_speaker": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_name": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_slug": "zak_raissi_barnet"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.45,
      "end": 11.45,
      "text": "Hello, good morning. Um, I just been transfer to you. I spoke with one of your um colleagues. I'm calling in regards to the cancellation.",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "identified_speaker": "CUSTOMER",
      "display_speaker": "Customer"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.45,
      "end": 17.45,
      "text": "Okay, no worries. And that was on uh it was Jason that sold you the car correct? HJ72.",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "identified_speaker": "CUSTOMER",
      "display_speaker": "Customer"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.45,
      "end": 18.45,
      "text": "Yes, please.",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "identified_speaker": "AGENT",
      "display_speaker": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_name": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_slug": "zak_raissi_barnet"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.45,
      "end": 21.45,
      "text": "And how many years warranty did you go for?",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "identified_speaker": "AGENT",
      "display_speaker": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_name": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_slug": "zak_raissi_barnet"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.45,
      "end": 22.45,
      "text": "Five.",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "identified_speaker": "AGENT",
      "display_speaker": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_name": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_slug": "zak_raissi_barnet"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.45,
      "end": 40.45,
      "text": "Five years. Alright, and uh, give me one second, I'll sort this out for you. So I'm just gonna check that you're still within the right cooling-off period, which I believe you are still within the period. 1, 2, 3, 4.",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "identified_speaker": "AGENT",
      "display_speaker": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_name": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_slug": "zak_raissi_barnet"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.45,
      "end": 42.45,
      "text": "Today will be the last day.",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "identified_speaker": "AGENT",
      "display_speaker": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_name": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_slug": "zak_raissi_barnet"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.45,
      "end": 45.45,
      "text": "Okay, so that means we have to solve it today.",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "identified_speaker": "AGENT",
      "display_speaker": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_name": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_slug": "zak_raissi_barnet"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.45,
      "end": 54.45,
      "text": "Yes, 'cause I tried to call you yesterday, but for some reason that called it didn't went through, and then my partner tried, so yeah...",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "identified_speaker": "AGENT",
      "display_speaker": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_name": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_slug": "zak_raissi_barnet"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.45,
      "end": 66.45,
      "text": "No stress, no stress, no stress. I'm going to leave a note now. Um, you should receive an email to confirm that your warranty has been refunded, bear with me.",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "identified_speaker": "CUSTOMER",
      "display_speaker": "Customer"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.45,
      "end": 74.45,
      "text": "Okay, one question please, very quick. So this was added on my finance. How this is going to affect my finance?",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "identified_speaker": "AGENT",
      "display_speaker": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_name": "Zak Raissi Barnet",
      "agent_slug": "zak_raissi_barnet"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.45,
      "end": 78.45,
      "text": "Bear with me, I'm just, give me one second please.",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "identified_speaker": "CUSTOMER",
      "display_speaker": "Customer"
    },
    {
      "start": 78.45,
      "end": 79.45,
      "text": "No worries.",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "identified_speaker": "CUSTOMER",
      "display_speaker": "Customer"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.45,
      "end": 82.45,
